a.fi"},{"lap":0,"text":"Amongst the deafening din of the cars, von Morgen lunged away from the first row to take an immediate lead, only to be passed moments later by Caracciola's huge Mercedes.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":1},{"lap":0,"text":"A crowd of about 50,000 had come to see the races.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi"},{"lap":0,"text":"It was muggy. There had been a slight drizzle just before the cars were started.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi"},{"lap":0,"text":"Amongst the deafening din of the cars, von Morgen lunged away from the first row to take an immediate lead, only to be passed moments later by Caracciola's huge Mercedes.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":1},{"lap":1,"text":"Knepper's Bugatti crashed at the right-hand turn just one kilometer after the start.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":15},{"lap":1,"text":"After four minutes the high metallic song of the Mercedes supercharger could be heard in the grandstands as Caracciola exited the forest area from M\u00fcllenbach with von Morgen close behind, then Burggaller, zu Leiningen and von Brauchitsch.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":0},{"lap":1,"text":"Knepper's Bugatti crashed at the right-hand turn just one kilometer after the start.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":15},{"lap":1,"text":"After four minutes the high metallic song of the Mercedes supercharger could be heard in the grandstands as Caracciola exited the forest area from M\u00fcllenbach with von Morgen close behind, then Burggaller, zu Leiningen and von Brauchitsch.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":0},{"lap":2,"text":"On the second lap von Morgen took the lead with Caracciola second.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":1},{"lap":2,"text":"On the second lap von Morgen took the lead with Caracciola second.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":1},{"lap":3,"text":"The following lap Caracciola was once more in front with von Morgen close behind, followed by Burggaller, von Brauchitsch and zu Leiningen.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":0},{"lap":3,"text":"The following lap Caracciola was once more in front with von Morgen close behind, followed by Burggaller, von Brauchitsch and zu Leiningen.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":0},{"lap":10,"text":"by lap 10 he had a two seconds advantage over von Morgen at an average speed of 108.5 km/h.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":0},{"lap":10,"text":"by lap 10 he had a two seconds advantage over von Morgen at an average speed of 108.5 km/h.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":0},{"lap":15,"text":"On lap 15 it was once more von Morgen in the lead at an average speed of 109.8 km/h, Caracciola second with 109.7 km/h.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":1},{"lap":15,"text":"Brauchitsch had worked himself into third place and left Burggaller and Leiningen behind. Seibel with a 1500 Bugatti held sixth place.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":2},{"lap":15,"text":"On lap 15 it was once more von Morgen in the lead at an average speed of 109.8 km/h, Caracciola second with 109.7 km/h.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":1},{"lap":15,"text":"Brauchitsch had worked himself into third place and left Burggaller and Leiningen behind. Seibel with a 1500 Bugatti held sixth place.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":2},{"lap":17,"text":"In the meantime the weather had changed into a brief rainstorm.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi"},{"lap":17,"text":"In the meantime the weather had changed into a brief rainstorm.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi"},{"lap":20,"text":"At half distance, lap 20, the speed had increased; von Morgen leading at 110.4 km/h, Caracciola 110.2 km/h behind, then von Brauchitsch, Burggaller and zu Leiningen.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":1},{"lap":20,"text":"At half distance, lap 20, the speed had increased; von Morgen leading at 110.4 km/h, Caracciola 110.2 km/h behind, then von Brauchitsch, Burggaller and zu Leiningen.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":1},{"lap":22,"text":"Von Morgen pits to refuel and change rear tyres, losing 2m47s; Caracciola leads.","q":false,"c":1},{"lap":22,"text":"In addition he took a swig of water and a cigarette.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":1},{"lap":22,"text":"Von Morgen pits to refuel and change rear tyres, losing 2m47s; Caracciola leads.","q":false,"c":1},{"lap":22,"text":"In addition he took a swig of water and a cigarette.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":1},{"lap":23,"text":"It started to rain again. Caracciola was now more than half a lap ahead.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":0},{"lap":23,"text":"It started to rain again. Caracciola was now more than half a lap ahead.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":0},{"lap":25,"text":"By lap 25 von Morgen had made up nine seconds of lost time.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":1},{"lap":25,"text":"Leiningen retires with clutch damage at the Scharfer Kopf.","q":false,"c":12},{"lap":25,"text":"By lap 25 von Morgen had made up nine seconds of lost time.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":1},{"lap":25,"text":"Leiningen retires with clutch damage at the Scharfer Kopf.","q":false,"c":12},{"lap":30,"text":"Mathilde Schulz retires with a defective engine.","q":false,"c":11},{"lap":30,"text":"On lap 30 Caracciola was leading at 109.3 km/h, with von Morgen in second place at 107.2 km/h, although he continued driving as if it was a matter of life and death.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":0},{"lap":30,"text":"Burggaller is out with a broken engine bearing.","q":false,"c":10},{"lap":30,"text":"Mathilde Schulz retires with a defective engine.","q":false,"c":11},{"lap":30,"text":"On lap 30 Caracciola was leading at 109.3 km/h, with von Morgen in second place at 107.2 km/h, although he continued driving as if it was a matter of life and death.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":0},{"lap":30,"text":"Burggaller is out with a broken engine bearing.","q":false,"c":10},{"lap":35,"text":"Von Morgen takes 40 seconds out of Caracciola's 150-second lead in five laps.","q":false,"c":1},{"lap":35,"text":"Von Morgen takes 40 seconds out of Caracciola's 150-second lead in five laps.","q":false,"c":1},{"lap":40,"text":"Caracciola wins in the rain; von Morgen second, just over a minute behind.","q":false,"c":0},{"lap":40,"text":"the newcomer von Brauchitsch was third, albeit twice lapped by Caracciola, Seibel's Bugatti fourth and Dr. Winter with a heavily mutilated arm finished fifth.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":2},{"lap":40,"text":"Caracciola wins in the rain; von Morgen second, just over a minute behind.","q":false,"c":0},{"lap":40,"text":"the newcomer von Brauchitsch was third, albeit twice lapped by Caracciola, Seibel's Bugatti fourth and Dr. Winter with a heavily mutilated arm finished fifth.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":2}]}